Package: TFootr
Title: Process Titles & Footnotes Table for Annotating TFLs/TLGs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gary", "Cao", , "Gary.Cao@UCB.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Amber", "Wu", , "amber.wu2@UCB.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Yao", "Lu", ,"Yao.Lu@UCB.com", role = "aut"))
Description: The appropriately placed titles and footnotes are essential parts for the clinical study reports (CSR). This `TFootr` package enables these metadata to be maintained in a separately located Excel spreadsheet for better handling. One can select the right titles or footnotes either based on output numbers, or the program names along with oid.
